#: src/iterators/collect.md:6
msgid "`collect`"
msgstr ""

#: src/iterators/collect.md:8
msgid ""
"The [`collect`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/iter/trait.Iterator."
"html#method.collect) method lets you build a collection from an [`Iterator`]"
"(https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/iter/trait.Iterator.html)."
msgstr ""

